Greenmole RDP adapts Apache Guacamole keyboard-layout data to interpret
negotiated RDP scan codes on macOS. The table representation, selection,
state handling and Norwegian compatibility overrides are downstream changes.
Source: https://github.com/apache/guacamole-server/tree/main/src/protocols/rdp/keymaps
